KJV: Adino.

H5723.definition:
dual of a feminine of H5706 (עַד); double prey;
Adithajim, a place in Palestine
KJV: Adithaim.

H5724.definition:
probably from an unused root of uncertain meaning;
Adlai, an Israelite
KJV: Adlai.

H5725.definition:
probably from the passive participle of the same as H5724 (עַדְלַי);
Adullam, a place in Palestine
KJV: Adullam.

H5726.definition:
patrial from H5725 (עֲדֻלָּם);
an Adullamite or native of Adullam
KJV: Adullamite.

H5727.definition:
