KJV: Oded.

H5753.definition:
a primitive root;
to crook, literally or figuratively
KJV: do amiss, bow down, make crooked, commit iniquity, pervert, (do) perverse(-ly), trouble, [idiom] turn, do wickedly, do wrong.

H5754.definition:
intensive from H5753 (עָוָה) abbreviated;
overthrow
KJV: [idiom] overturn.

H5755.definition:
or עַוָּא; (2 Kings 17:24), for H5754 (עַוָּה);
