KJV: Ava, Ivah.

H5756.definition:
a primitive root;
to be strong; causatively, to stregthen, i.e. (figuratively) to save (by flight)
KJV: gather (self, self to flee), retire.

H5757.definition:
patrial from H5755 (עִוָּה);
